+## Request 13: Vouchers
+**Status**: ✅ Completed and tested
+
+### What was done
+- Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` to src/invoices.js
+- Voucher is a fixed-amount discount applied AFTER VAT
+- Restrictions:
+  - One voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error)
+  - Draft invoices only (NOT_DRAFT error)
+  - Amount must be positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)
+- Updated `invoiceTotals` to:
+  - Return voucher field (amount or 0 if none)
+  - Calculate total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher
+  - Clamp result at 0 (never negative)
+- Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error code
+- Added 10 comprehensive tests covering:
+  - Voucher application and calculation
+  - Status restrictions (draft only)
+  - Duplicate voucher prevention
+  - Amount validation
+  - Effect on invoice totals
+  - Immutability
+
 ## Next steps
 - Add invoice persistence/retrieval
 - Add more reporting/analytics
